WEBVTT

1
00:00:01,620 --> 00:00:05,060
Brother Fang, Uncle Mu Ying is going to pay dividends. Where is the money?

2
00:00:05,060 --> 00:00:08,020
Hahaha, Brother Chu, don’t worry, the money is in the house.

3
00:00:08,020 --> 00:00:11,140
Let the document be verified and the contract documents will be distributed to you.

4
00:00:11,140 --> 00:00:20,240
Sir, look who's coming

5
00:00:20,240 --> 00:00:25,030
why are you here

6
00:00:25,030 --> 00:00:29,400
Brother Fang Yang, I have difficulties regarding breaking off the engagement.

7
00:00:29,400 --> 00:00:32,400
When we broke off the engagement, I already told you

8
00:00:32,400 --> 00:00:36,650
You and I have nothing to do with each other anymore. Now you come to see me.

9
00:00:36,650 --> 00:00:39,070
Isn’t it a little funny?

10
00:00:39,070 --> 00:00:46,220
Brother Fang Yang, you were not like this before

11
00:00:47,710 --> 00:00:50,610
Miss Song comes to my Chengguo Kung Fu in the middle of the night

12
00:00:50,610 --> 00:00:52,970
Aren't you afraid that the collision driver will blame you?
